    <briefdescription>
<para>Operation unavailable error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1OperationUnavailableError" kindref="compound">OperationUnavailableError</ref> represents an error where an operation cannot be performed due to current system or application state.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>OperationUnavailableError();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>OperationUnavailableError(&quot;Service<sp/>unavailable<sp/>during<sp/>shutdown&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
